  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For a uniformly charged thin spherical shell, the electric potential <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>V</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;radially away from the centre <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>O</mi></mfenced></math> of shell can be graphically represented as</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bbb24b56-cd7e-470b-b5be-66acbb58458a-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 219px;\" /></p>",
